; THE VERBS, WITH COVERAGE BEHIND THEM.
;
; Chakra Petch SemiBold carries the Buttons — the title screen's primaries and every
; action row. Sharp and slightly technical, which suits a tower of sigils, and it stays
; legible at the 16-19 px the front door actually uses.
;
; ⚠ IT REPLACED BANGERS, AND THE REASON IS WHY YOU LOOK AT A THING IN MOTION. Bangers
; was chosen off a static specimen and shipped; the maker played it and said it was not
; clear enough. A specimen sheet answers "what does this letterform look like" and does
; not answer "can I read my own buttons mid-fight". The second question is the one that
; matters and only the game can ask it.
;
; DejaVu Sans sits in `fallbacks` because Godot resolves a missing glyph PER CHARACTER
; down this chain. A theme's `default_font` does NOT serve as that fallback: once a
; control resolves to this face the theme default is out of the picture entirely, and a
; button reading "SINGLE PLAYER  >" would be back to depending on whatever the host OS
; happens to ship. `probe_font_candidates.gd` measured DejaVu at 24/24 of the glyphs
; `slice_test_font_coverage` had to substitute.
